Package: emlcorpus
Title: Units and Ecological Context in the EDI EML Corpus
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("EDI Units Working Group", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible analysis of units of measure and their ecological
    context in Ecological Metadata Language (EML) records from the
    Environmental Data Initiative repository. Supports evidence-based
    proposals of QUDT QuantityKinds with ecological context and rules for
    associating them with units.
